{
  "__inputs": [
    {
      "name": "DS_PROMETHEUS",
      "label": "Prometheus",
      "description": "Data source Prometheus que scrapea GET /metrics de WebAPIDevSecOps (paso 4.17)",
      "type": "datasource",
      "pluginId": "prometheus",
      "pluginName": "Prometheus"
    }
  ],
  "__requires": [
    { "type": "grafana", "id": "grafana", "name": "Grafana", "version": "9.0.0" },
    { "type": "panel", "id": "timeseries", "name": "Time series", "version": "" },
    { "type": "panel", "id": "stat", "name": "Stat", "version": "" },
    { "type": "datasource", "id": "prometheus", "name": "Prometheus", "version": "1.0.0" }
  ],
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": { "type": "grafana", "uid": "-- Grafana --" },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      }
    ]
  },
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Métricas de Calidad (paso 4.16 — Meter WebAPIDevSecOps.QualityMetrics)",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Cobertura de código",
      "description": "Umbral CI: check_coverage.py exige >= 45% (paso 3.27). Alerta sugerida: test_coverage_percent < 45",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 1 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 45 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 75 }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "test_coverage_percent", "legendFormat": "Cobertura" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Mutation Score (Stryker)",
      "description": "Thresholds stryker-config.json (paso 4.2): <60 break (bloquea CI), 60-70 low, >=80 high. Alerta sugerida: mutation_score_percent < 70",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 1 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 60 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 80 }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "mutation_score_percent", "legendFormat": "Mutation score" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Sonar Quality Gate",
      "description": "1 = PASS, 0 = FAIL. Alerta sugerida: sonar_quality_gate_passed == 0",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 1 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "green", "value": 1 }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            { "options": { "0": { "text": "FAIL", "color": "red" }, "1": { "text": "PASS", "color": "green" } }, "type": "value" }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sonar_quality_gate_passed", "legendFormat": "Quality gate" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Latencia P95 (NBomber)",
      "description": "Umbrales por escenario (pasos 4.7-4.9): login <500ms, producto <200ms, venta <1000ms. Alerta sugerida: p95_latency_ms_milliseconds > 500",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 1 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "min": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 300 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 500 }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "p95_latency_ms_milliseconds", "legendFormat": "P95" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 7 },
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Operacional (instrumentación ASP.NET Core / Kestrel)",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "P95 latencia HTTP por ruta",
      "description": "P95 de la duración real de requests (histograma http_server_request_duration_seconds) por ruta",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 8 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }] },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, http_route) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m]))) * 1000",
          "legendFormat": "{{http_route}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Requests por segundo",
      "description": "Tasa de requests por ruta y status code (rate de http_server_request_duration_seconds_count)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 8 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }] },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (http_route, http_response_status_code) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{http_route}} {{http_response_status_code}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Conexiones activas",
      "description": "Conexiones activas/encoladas en Kestrel + requests HTTP en vuelo",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 16 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }] },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "kestrel_active_connections", "legendFormat": "Conexiones activas" },
        { "refId": "B", "expr": "kestrel_queued_connections", "legendFormat": "Conexiones encoladas" },
        { "refId": "C", "expr": "http_server_active_requests", "legendFormat": "Requests en vuelo" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Rate limiting rechazados (429)",
      "description": "Requests rechazados por las políticas de rate limiting (LoginPolicy 5/5min, AdminPolicy 200/min, ConcurrentWritesPolicy 10)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 16 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 60,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }] },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(increase(aspnetcore_rate_limiting_requests_total{aspnetcore_rate_limiting_result=\"rejected\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "Rechazados 5m"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 24 },
      "id": 11,
      "title": "Alertas sugeridas (reutilizan thresholds de 4.2 / 4.11 / 3.27)",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Alertas PromQL sugeridas",
      "description": "Expresiones para reglas de alerta en Grafana o Prometheus",
      "datasource": { "type": "datasource", "uid": "grafana", "name": "Grafana" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 25 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Alertas sugeridas\n\n| Alerta | Expresión | Condición | Origen threshold |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Mutation score bajo | `mutation_score_percent < 70` | 5 min | stryker-config.json (4.2: break 60, low 70, high 80) |\n| Cobertura baja | `test_coverage_percent < 45` | 5 min | check_coverage.py (3.27: >= 45%) |\n| P95 lento | `p95_latency_ms_milliseconds > 500` | 10 min | LoginScenario (4.7: <500ms); producto 200ms, venta 1000ms (4.8/4.9) |\n| Quality gate rojo | `sonar_quality_gate_passed == 0` | 5 min | SonarCloud Quality Gate (3.26) |\n| Rate limit saturando | `sum(increase(aspnetcore_rate_limiting_requests_total{aspnetcore_rate_limiting_result=\"rejected\"}[5m])) > 0` | 5 min | Políticas Program.cs (3.7) |"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      }
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "30s",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "tags": ["calidad", "devsecops", "webapidevsecops", "prometheus"],
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "time": { "from": "now-30d", "to": "now" },
  "timepicker": {},
  "timezone": "browser",
  "title": "WebAPIDevSecOps - Calidad",
  "uid": "webapidevsecops-quality",
  "version": 1,
  "weekStart": ""
}
